  "notes": "Osnovna škola is compulsory from age 6 and lasts 9 years in three cycles (grades 1–3, 4–6, 7–9). Gimnazija lasts 4 years; vocational schools 3–4 years. Teaching is also given in Serbian, Bosnian, Croatian and Albanian; Albanian-medium schools' own names are not included."
